[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]性格与形象[/font][/b]


基于史料的分析：

[color=#000000]政治家面向（史料最充分）：[/color]

[indent]•  赏罚极严而公平："尽忠益时者虽仇必赏，犯法怠慢者虽亲必罚"（陈寿评）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  循名责实，"虚伪不齿"，吏不容奸[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  个人廉洁：自陈家产薄田十五顷，卒时确无余财[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  对刘禅的态度：持续谦恭，充满焦虑（出师表语气），不是强权操控，而是忧虑托付不效[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[color=#000000]军事面向：[/color]

[indent]•  陈寿定论："治戎为长，奇谋为短，理民之干，优于将略"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  治军严整、赏罚分明，但行动偏于谨慎稳重[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  拒绝[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "魏延", "cat": "people"}]魏延[/url][/color][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "子午谷", "cat": "geography"}]子午谷[/url][/color]奇谋（风险控制优先）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  发明木牛流马、损益连弩、八阵图（《三国志》明确记载）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[color=#000000]情感面向（可感知但史料有限）：[/color]

[indent]•  对刘备的报恩之情：出师表"由是感激，遂许先帝以驱驰……夙夜忧叹"[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  对马谡：器重而误用，斩后深以为憾[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  临死前的状态：五丈原分兵屯田，有久驻之意，病发猝然[/indent]
